---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Gothic II: New Balance - Wiki en Español">
	<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-red-400 border-b-2 border-red-500/30 pb-3 mb-6">Gothic II: New Balance</h1>

	<div class="bg-gray-800/50 border-l-4 border-red-500 p-5 rounded-r-lg mb-8">
		<p class="text-gray-300 mb-1">Guía completa del mod <strong class="text-white">New Balance</strong> para <strong class="text-white">Gothic II: La Noche del Cuervo</strong>, traducida al español.</p>
		<p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Contenido original: <a href="https://nb.mody.sefaris.eu/" target="_blank" class="text-red-400 hover:text-red-300">nb.mody.sefaris.eu</a></p>
	</div>

	<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-red-300 mt-8 mb-4">📖 Contenido</h2>

	<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
		<a href="/configuracion/gothic-ini" class="block bg-gray-800/60 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-red-500/50 hover:bg-gray-800 transition-all no-underline group">
			<h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2 group-hover:text-red-400">⚙️ Configuración Gothic.ini</h3>
			<p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Variables, fuego fatuo, presets, colores y misiones ocultas.</p>
		</a>
	</div>

	<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-red-300 mt-8 mb-4">⚔️ Misiones por capítulo</h2>
	<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8">
		<a href="/misiones/capitulo-1" class="block bg-gray-800/60 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-red-500/50 transition-all no-underline group">
			<h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-red-400">Capítulo I</h3>
			<p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Khorinis, camino a la ciudad, ciudadano, wátek Gallahada y más.</p>
		</a>
		<a href="/misiones/capitulo-2" class="block bg-gray-800/60 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-red-500/50 transition-all no-underline group">
			<h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-red-400">Capítulo II</h3>
			<p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Khorinis, Jarkendar (Magos de Agua, Piratas, Bandidos) y Valle Minero.</p>
		</a>
		<a href="/misiones/capitulo-3" class="block bg-gray-800/60 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-red-500/50 transition-all no-underline group">
			<h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-red-400">Capítulo III</h3>
			<p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Bennet, campamento propio, Ojo de Innos.</p>
		</a>
		<a href="/misiones/capitulo-4" class="block bg-gray-800/60 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-red-500/50 transition-all no-underline group">
			<h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-red-400">Capítulo IV</h3>
			<p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Invasión orca, caza de dragones, huevos de dragón.</p>
		</a>
		<a href="/misiones/capitulo-5" class="block bg-gray-800/60 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-red-500/50 transition-all no-underline group">
			<h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-red-400">Capítulo V</h3>
			<p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Orden oscura, tripulación, viaje a Irdorath.</p>
		</a>
		<a href="/misiones/secundarias" class="block bg-gray-800/60 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-red-500/50 transition-all no-underline group">
			<h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1 group-hover:text-red-400">Secundarias</h3>
			<p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Piedras rúnicas, poder ilimitado, garra de Beliar y más.</p>
		</a>
	</div>

	<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-red-300 mt-8 mb-4">🛡️ Gremios principales</h2>
	<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-8">
		<a href="/gremios/cazador-demonios" class="block bg-gray-800/40 border border-gray-700/50 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-red-500/40 transition-all no-underline group">
			<span class="text-gray-300 group-hover:text-red-400 text-sm">Cazador de Demonios</span>
		</a>
		<a href="/gremios/cazador-dragones" class="block bg-gray-800/40 border border-gray-700/50 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-red-500/40 transition-all no-underline group">
			<span class="text-gray-300 group-hover:text-red-400 text-sm">Mercenario / Cazador de Dragones</span>
		</a>
		<a href="/gremios/mago-fuego" class="block bg-gray-800/40 border border-gray-700/50 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-red-500/40 transition-all no-underline group">
			<span class="text-gray-300 group-hover:text-red-400 text-sm">Mago de Fuego</span>
		</a>
		<a href="/gremios/mago-agua" class="block bg-gray-800/40 border border-gray-700/50 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-red-500/40 transition-all no-underline group">
			<span class="text-gray-300 group-hover:text-red-400 text-sm">Mago de Agua</span>
		</a>
		<a href="/gremios/caballero-oscuro" class="block bg-gray-800/40 border border-gray-700/50 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-red-500/40 transition-all no-underline group">
			<span class="text-gray-300 group-hover:text-red-400 text-sm">Caballero Oscuro</span>
		</a>
		<a href="/gremios/nigromante" class="block bg-gray-800/40 border border-gray-700/50 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-red-500/40 transition-all no-underline group">
			<span class="text-gray-300 group-hover:text-red-400 text-sm">Nigromante / Invocador</span>
		</a>
		<a href="/gremios/condenado" class="block bg-gray-800/40 border border-gray-700/50 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-red-500/40 transition-all no-underline group">
			<span class="text-gray-300 group-hover:text-red-400 text-sm">Condenado</span>
		</a>
		<a href="/gremios/guardia-paladin" class="block bg-gray-800/40 border border-gray-700/50 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-red-500/40 transition-all no-underline group">
			<span class="text-gray-300 group-hover:text-red-400 text-sm">Guardia / Paladín</span>
		</a>
		<a href="/gremios/guardian-guru" class="block bg-gray-800/40 border border-gray-700/50 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-red-500/40 transition-all no-underline group">
			<span class="text-gray-300 group-hover:text-red-400 text-sm">Guardián del Templo / Gurú</span>
		</a>
		<a href="/gremios/explorador" class="block bg-gray-800/40 border border-gray-700/50 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-red-500/40 transition-all no-underline group">
			<span class="text-gray-300 group-hover:text-red-400 text-sm">Explorador</span>
		</a>
	</div>

	<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-red-300 mt-8 mb-4">🔗 Enlaces útiles</h2>
	<ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-400">
		<li>📦 <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/16CPrngIhKSiwGtmHGXCJE5o_w-4k_s_nNq7H7wzVwos/" target="_blank" class="text-red-400 hover:text-red-300">Lista de todos los objetos (Google Sheets)</a></li>
		<li>📥 <a href="https://sefaris.eu/new-balance/installation" target="_blank" class="text-red-400 hover:text-red-300">Instalación</a></li>
		<li>🌐 <a href="https://sefaris.eu/" target="_blank" class="text-red-400 hover:text-red-300">Página de Sefaris</a></li>
		<li>💬 <a href="https://discord.gg/9EVFJv5Uyf" target="_blank" class="text-red-400 hover:text-red-300">Servidor de Discord</a></li>
		<li>💻 <a href="https://github.com/Sefaris/nb-wiki" target="_blank" class="text-red-400 hover:text-red-300">Código fuente (GitHub)</a></li>
	</ul>

	<div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-gray-800 text-sm text-gray-500">
		<p>Agradecimientos especiales a <strong>Marek Z</strong> — autor de la versión original de la guía, y al <strong>Team Sefaris</strong>.</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
